blurb: The South Portland Board of Education announced plans to delay the elementary
  school reconfiguration until fall 2027 in response to significant community feedback.
  The board also discussed its upcoming budget presentation to the City Council, ultimately
  voting to request an additional 1% tax increase for the contingency fund and to
  explore shifting certain municipal service costs.
