  topic: Board Discussion on City Council Budget Request
  desc: The board discussed three potential requests to make to the City Council for
    the FY27 budget. Options included asking for a tax increase to restore staff,
    a tax increase for the contingency fund, or having the city absorb costs for shared
    services like SROs and snow removal.
  children: []
