  topic: Board Discussion on Use of Potential Funds
  desc: The administration asked for guidance on how to use the $360,000 in savings
    if the City Council agrees to offset service costs. After discussion, the board
    voted 3-2 to direct any such savings into the contingency fund, with two members
    preferring to restore cut positions.
  children: []
